          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The series is celebrating its 20th anniversary with a new game for the Nintendo 3DS. The title of the game is Bokujō Monogatari: Mitsu no Sato no Taisetsu na Tomodachi (Harvest Moon/Story of Seasons: Precious Friends From Three Villages).\n\nThe game will have at least three locales: Lulucoco Town, Tsuyukusa Village and Wes Town. The culture of each will be completely different. Lulucoco is an island settlement, Tsuyukusa is a Japanese village, and Wes Town is a western-style town.\n\nThe game will feature a protagonist - female or male - and the characters Noel, Miranda, Megan, and Frank from Wes Town.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
